{"id":1501,"title":"Python有main()函数吗？","summary":"Python有main()函数吗？","tags":"","components":[{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"501ddb8e-0392-395d-93eb-0bf51c578343","knowledge_id":183,"title":"Python有main()函数吗？","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":0,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":183,"title":"Python有main()函数吗？","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"af3149f0-0a81-37aa-9101-462abe0da16b","title":"","title_html":"","text":"Python 没有 `main()` 函数。但是，我们可以使用模块的 `__name__`属性来模拟它。\n\n在 Python 中，如果模块独立运行，则内置属性`__name__`的值总是 `'__main__'`。\n\n因此，可以通过一个 `if` 条件来检查文件是否是由模块本身执行的。如果是，则通过手动创建来运行 `main()` 函数。\n\n让我们来看一个例子：","text_html":"<p>Python 没有 <code>main()</code> 函数。但是，我们可以使用模块的 <code>__name__</code>属性来模拟它。</p>\n<p>在 Python 中，如果模块独立运行，则内置属性<code>__name__</code>的值总是 <code>&#x27;__main__&#x27;</code>。</p>\n<p>因此，可以通过一个 <code>if</code> 条件来检查文件是否是由模块本身执行的。如果是，则通过手动创建来运行 <code>main()</code> 函数。</p>\n<p>让我们来看一个例子：</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"f614c31d-495a-36af-a4c8-77384f5e984b","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"def main():\n    print('this is main function')\n\nif __name__ == '__main__':\n    main()","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":1}]}}],"status":"undo","course_no":"027","source_url":"https://edu.py2fun.com/api/course/027/page/1501"}
